# ERC-S — Stochastic Extension

## Description

This module extends the deterministic model by introducing stochasticity.

## Goal

Test whether the recoverability boundary persists under noise and variability.

## Key Questions

- Does return probability decrease near the boundary?
- Does noise accelerate loss of recoverability?

## Contents

- `ERC-S_stochastic_extension.pdf`
- `ERC-S_stochastic.ipynb`
- `figures/`

## Interpretation

Suggests that recoverability is not only structural, but also probabilistic under real conditions.

## Status

Extension of ERC-D. Still minimal and falsifiable.
